			"notes": "### Additions\n\n- **Added** the ability to customize tags to form extra collapsible entries. The tags are stored as an array in `/config/reicollapsibleentries.toml`. With **ModMenu** installed, you can also toggle the tags in an in-game GUI. What's more, using command `/reicollapsibleentries tags` will print all the available tags of the hand held item, by clicking one of them you will be able to open a window to perform actions such as add to custom tag, remove from custom tag and copy to clipboard."
